{
  "Kind": "MindAttic dev environment",
  "About": "The development tools setup-host.ps1 installs on a new machine (M.ORCH-T1489), curated from winget export of the main PC: developer tools, SDKs, editors, runtimes and redistributables only. No games, chat apps, browsers, VPNs, drivers or personal tools; no versions (winget takes the newest), no license keys, no machine paths. Each entry: Id (winget id, source winget), Name, optional Override (the installer's own arguments, replacing winget's silent ones). Edit this file to change what a new machine gets; setup-host skips anything already installed.",
